<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-bombyx-mori-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bombyx mori Turing wavenumber selection at 41 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg Jacobian, analytic σ(k), and a 1D operator-split growth rate agree at Pearson r = 0.9923, with the peak at 41.016 µm. The 41 µm carrier is now placed at 41 × 1.11 px. Lean theorems witness the 2π identity, the 55 µm domestication shift, Dv/Du > 1, and the sign split of σ." ;
